{"data":{"aggr_type":1,"audio_id":"7450115760640229924","content":"\n\n\n<header><div class=\"tt-title\">“海阳船”再发“海阳箭”——谷神星一号海遥四运载火箭发射成功</div><div class=\"authorbar\" style=\"padding-bottom:3px;\"><div class=\"avatar\"><a class=\"author-avatar-link\"><div class=\"author-avatar\"><img class=\"author-avatar-img\" src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/user-avatar/14194628f142c924cb14b638f6b04d91~300x300.image?_iz=112761&from=tt_user.tuwen&lk3s=06827d14&x-expires=1792800000&x-signature=dlFmE6D9cb2gBOZyvS0NLEj370Q%3D\"></div></a></div><div class=\"author-function-buttons\"><button class=\"follow-button\"></button></div><div class=\"author-bar\"><div class=\"name-link-wrap\"><div class=\"name-link-w\"><a class=\"author-name-link pgc-link\">闪电新闻</a></div></div><a class=\"sub-title-w\"><span class=\"sub-title\">1734615075</span></a></div></div></header>\n\n\n<article><a class=\"image\"  href=\"bytedance://large_image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fp3-sign.toutiaoimg.com%2Flarge%2Ftos-cn-i-tjoges91tu%2F0db73b409bfcbc388e7995c7460eff7a%3F_iz%3D31825%26bid%3D10%26from%3Darticle.detail%26gid%3D7450114952884503059%26lk3s%3D06827d14%26x-expires%3D1823670470%26x-signature%3DrLhYm9h%252Bpwl0sdjW2P2T4hPgrVw%253D&index=0\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" thumb_width=\"120\" thumb_height=\"80\" zip_src_path=\"eJzs1k1vlEAYwPHvMgmcYJk3GNiEGNd60KipZl3TmqZhYICpvDkvQrfZ727aauNxJca0DUcuD_zg-Ye5Ab2SlezA-gZY1Wiw_gpqYwa9DoKB-FpW3cr01sisl221yvs2aDJVicD02s87X_rmqq-ETpCxASw4I5zChJc5z0kcC5YkYc5oBEVZsuzFpdynBMU4dLksUgTdUvVtmikj80asCmEy2biVLFJGQ4gQTUIcxzSEBIaJ23wjOoVRjFmBqDv5YhqkEjpFMSYRg5RBd7p74MxYJVL1rj5rk9rBm2FsoC6uvuBTvKX1aaV2o0NOgLdAnxn0wgNWSbAG80Hg4AFT25bfB3E77O5y3jDv2Kbm3-O_fgHzqdyedC_30L663vJiYOfUSgdvJgdv6u7NUcu2UJ8g9eLggVHw4fKPNpbFXqhPnvrwy5hPWt2GAX4H8tfHqXuyDn7AYIwofPxvle7fvj77cH790cGb9zvzHQ87gdrd54irFh61Pgv5GZAfyvkXtF8NHX4GAAD__3828wM=\"  ></a><div class=\"business-container-rtb\" data-content='{\"selector\":\"business-container-brand\"}'></div><p>齐鲁网·<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"77890754285170173\" qid=\"6962208840875394288\" mention-index=\"0\">闪电新闻</span>12月19日讯 12月19日下午，万众瞩目之下，由<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"5815487609112530553\" qid=\"1692128133760251702\" mention-index=\"0\">海阳</span>总装出厂的谷神星一号海遥四运载火箭搭乘“东方航天港”号发射船，喷射烈焰，拔地而起，将天启星座04组卫星（33星至36星）共4颗卫星搭载送入高度850km、<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"1140837504906020782\" qid=\"6156504548267214677\" mention-index=\"0\">倾角</span>45°的<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"5119108781971227228\" qid=\"1506547421130512497\" mention-index=\"0\">近地轨道</span>，发射任务取得圆满成功。</p><div class=\"business-container-rtb\" data-content='{\"selector\":\"business-container-rtb\"}'></div><p>本次发射的天启星座04组卫星由<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"7108947191348565259\" qid=\"4191739302407121775\" mention-index=\"0\">北京国电高科科技有限公司</span>抓总、山东<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"564440152341067919\" qid=\"5563709707672818328\" mention-index=\"0\">华宇航天</span>空间技术有限公司（航科513所）承担研制，用户为北京国电高科科技有限公司。4颗卫星入轨后将利用自身的推进系统完成四星在轨布相，使相邻两星的<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"7516874034207286700\" qid=\"6094333603107483375\" mention-index=\"0\">相位</span>间隔90°，并将轨道高度抬升至900km，通过搭载DCS载荷，可提供全球范围内的数据采集服务。设计由38颗卫星组网的天启星座，建成后将有效解决地面网络覆盖不到的海上、空中及偏远区域物联网络接入问题。</p><p>“谷神星一号海射型运载火箭为北京<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"360199273671143059\" qid=\"3989906507773020451\" mention-index=\"0\">星河动力</span>装备科技有限公司基于<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"5611318473195753893\" qid=\"9044699619226901913\" mention-index=\"0\">谷神星一号运载火箭</span>为满足海上发射适应性改进的产品。”星河动力相关负责人介绍，此次飞行试验为火箭方案验证性试验任务，用于进一步验证谷神星一号海射型运载火箭设计方案的正确性，火箭系统发射场工作流程的合理性，火箭系统、卫星系统、发射与保障系统、测控系统、发射船系统等各大系统的协调性，同时获取飞行试验数据，进一步验证火箭性能，积累飞行试验可靠性数据。</p><p>谷神星一号海遥四运载火箭的成功发射也意味着海阳成功保障了14次海上发射任务，累计将79颗卫星送入太空，海上发射流程逐步标准化，彰显了海阳常态化海上发射能力加速形成，海上发射地位全面确立。</p><p>东方航天港海上发射列入中国航天白皮书，海阳航空航天产业集群被确定为省级战略性新兴产业集群……2019年以来，抢抓我国第一次海上发射机遇，海阳深耕产业链条，聚力精准招商，不断释放产业倍增效应。先后引入<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"5152812665883579368\" qid=\"8050308004460592906\" mention-index=\"0\">中国长征火箭</span>、星河动力、九天行歌等标杆企业，招引集聚航空航天产业项目23个，总投资约273亿元，构建起集海上发射、星箭产研、卫星应用、配套集成、航天文旅为一体的<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"6931162877861762311\" qid=\"1802178184490585843\" mention-index=\"0\">全产业链</span>生态圈。</p><p>如今在海阳，围绕火箭发射及配套服务等展开的航天产业相关项目正不断传来好消息——今年上半年，东方空间、星河动力、长征火箭二期、卫星数据产业园、智算中心一期、来福士北区扩建等13个重点项目相继建成投产，山东陆海装备海阳基地、箭元科技、<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"6266664597709175070\" qid=\"3253992780076818490\" mention-index=\"0\">中核</span>科技馆等重点项目陆续开工建设。一个个项目相连，串起一条动能澎湃的产业链，海阳“向天图强”前景光明。</p><p>星辰大海步履不息。未来，海阳将围绕聚焦聚力发射能力提升、火箭产业链条完善、卫星产业培育、航天文旅发展、低空经济领域开拓和园区配套提升等六大板块，加快打造“链条完备、配套齐全、共建共享、融合耦合”的商业航天海上发射“策源地”。争取2030年前实现每年百次发射、量产百发火箭、天上百颗卫星、营收超过百亿，将海阳市商业航天产业打造成<span class=\"candidate-entity-word\" data-gid=\"579559793682211160\" qid=\"4737267510467561335\" mention-index=\"0\">山东省</span>新质生产力新标杆。</p><p>闪电新闻记者 马帅 通讯员 姜祥 徐盛世 报道</p></article>\n\n\n<footer></footer>\n","content_hash":"e6b66251","group_id":7450114952884503059,"group_source":2,"h5_extra":{"audio_info":{"audioDuration":248,"audioGroupID":"7450115760640229924","audioID":7450115760640229924,"audioWatchBar":"LARGE_BAR","audioWatchBarContent":"听全文","audioWatchCount":27,"audioWatchCountShowText":"文章较长试试听","logPB":{"audioGroupSource":"578","category_name":"toutiao_audio","recommend_reason":"文章较长试试听","stream_channel_id":"0"},"playerSchema":"sslocal://detail/audio_new?enter_from=click_headline&force_player_style=2&group_id=7450115760640229924&group_source=2&launch_player_page=1&module=tingtoutiao_module&scene=tingtoutiao"},"avatar":"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/user-avatar/14194628f142c924cb14b638f6b04d91~300x300.image?_iz=112761&from=tt_user.tuwen&lk3s=06827d14&x-expires=1792800000&x-signature=dlFmE6D9cb2gBOZyvS0NLEj370Q%3D","diversity":{"publish_loc_info":"山东"},"g_composition":8,"g_source":2,"is_lite":1,"is_original":false,"itemCell":{"actionCtrl":{"actionBar":{"actionSettingList":[{"actionType":1,"styleSetting":{"iconKey":"分享的Icon","layo